ompact, weaving, knitting, and TFO doubled yarns. In addition, the company offers various spur gears, helical gears, worm gears, timing belt pulleys, bevel gears, ring gears. It serves construction, cement, textile, recycling, paper, steel, food, mining, material handling, sugar, power, rubber, plastic, crane, chemical, packaging, foundry, and agriculture industries. The company was formerly known as Super Sales Agencies Limited and changed its name to Super Sales India Limited in 2005. Super Sales India Limited was incorporated in 1981 and is based in Coimbatore, India."}}